MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The portable SSD fits my interest in practical computer accessories because I could use it to move files between computers and projects.",
    "The microSD card connects directly to my earlier memory card and Raspberry Pi purchases, provided my setup supports it. The over-ear headphones also feel like a natural alternative to the wired headphones I have used."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The streaming sticks, smart display, and camera bundle serve entertainment or home monitoring needs that I have not been working toward with my computer setup purchases.",
    "Storage capacity alone does not make the enterprise drive useful to me: I want portable storage, not a 16TB internal drive. Likewise, earbuds do not fit my current preference for over-ear listening."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in electronics seems to have been stretched into an interest in smart home and streaming devices, even though those solve different problems.",
    "My headphone and memory card purchases seem to have been treated too broadly; the way I wear headphones and use storage matters more than simply offering another audio or storage product."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My cables, adapters, keyboard accessories, cable organizers, and computer cleaning purchases point toward maintaining and improving a practical computer workspace.",
    "My Raspberry Pi purchases make compatible project storage relevant, while my wired headphones and under-desk headphone holder make over-ear listening a stronger connection than earbuds."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "Some suggestions understood my computer accessory and project needs, but many stretched that interest into unrelated electronics purchases."
}
